      "writtenOn": "2020-05-20T23:43:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e this code is more generic and doesn\u0027t require (yet another) config option that someone might forget to enable (or set incorrectly).\n\nThis can be alleviated with BUILD_ASSERT. And you have tests too now.\n\nGenerally the EC philosophy is to do things at compile time.",
